title: NodeGroupsStart
---
<<declare $has_met_guard = false>>
<<declare $is_friend = false>>

You approach the castle gate.
<<jump SpeakToGuard>>
===

title: SpeakToGuard
when: $has_met_guard == false
---
Guard: Halt! Who goes there?
Player: Just a traveller.
Guard: Hmm, very well. State your business.
<<set $has_met_guard = true>>
<<jump AfterGuard>>
===

title: SpeakToGuard
when: $is_friend == true
---
Guard: Ah, my friend! Welcome back!
Guard: The king speaks highly of you.
Player: Good to see you too, old friend.
<<jump AfterGuard>>
===

title: SpeakToGuard
when: $has_met_guard == true
---
Guard: Back again, traveller?
Player: Indeed. May I pass?
Guard: Go ahead.
<<set $is_friend = true>>
<<jump AfterGuard>>
===

title: AfterGuard
---
You walk through the gate into the courtyard.
<<if $is_friend == false>>
    You feel you should visit again to build trust.
    <<jump SpeakToGuard>>
<<else>>
    The guard now considers you a friend!
<<endif>>
===
